459:
Any person applying for a permit required by this article shall, either in writing or in person, furnish to the city commission the following information:
(1) Name of carnival, circus, or traveling show, together with the names and home addresses of the owners and managers thereof;
(2) Name of any local organization sponsoring the appearance in the city;
