480:
(a) In addition to the penalties contained in section 12-289, any license issued under this article may be suspended or revoked for any of the following reasons:
(1) Fraud, misrepresentation, or knowingly providing a false statement contained in the application for the license;
(2) Fraud, misrepresentation, or knowingly providing a false statement in the course of carrying on the business of vending;
(3) Conducting the business of vending in any manner contrary to the conditions of the license;
